# Commands

Purpose:
  CLI commands for SDDRA system in Claude AI.

Files:
  sdd: @sdd.sdd
  sdd-analyze: @sdd-analyze.sdd
  sdd-status: @sdd-status.sdd
  sdd-decisions: @sdd-decisions.sdd
  sdd-health: @sdd-health.sdd
  sdd-backup: @sdd-backup.sdd
  sdd-restore: @sdd-restore.sdd
  sdd-resume: @sdd-resume.sdd

Commands:
  /sdd: Execute chain graph from prompt
  /sdd-analyze: Analyze .sdd/ structure
  /sdd-status: Show execution status
  /sdd-decisions: List decisions
  /sdd-health: Check system integrity
  /sdd-backup: Create backup of critical files
  /sdd-restore: Restore from backup
  /sdd-resume: Resume from checkpoint

State: +
